      "writtenOn": "2023-08-07T10:11:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ignoring this still feels wrong.\nIf we can\u0027t handle simultaneous connections (which something else should be preventing?), shouldn\u0027t we reject a new one?",
